{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $28+56t+28w$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}28+56t+28w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{28+56t+28w}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{28}{2}+\\dfrac{56t}{2}+\\dfrac{28w}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(14+28t+14w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $28+56t+28w$ is *not* equivalent to $2(56+112t+56w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $28$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}28+56t+28w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=28\\left(\\dfrac{28+56t+28w}{28}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=28\\left(\\dfrac{28}{28}+\\dfrac{56t}{28}+\\dfrac{28w}{28}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=28(1+2t+w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $28+56t+28w$ is equivalent to $28(1+2t+w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $4$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}28+56t+28w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{28+56t+28w}{4}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{28}{4}+\\dfrac{56t}{4}+\\dfrac{28w}{4}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4(7+14t+7w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $28+56t+28w$ is *not* equivalent to $4(7+13t+7w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $7$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}28+56t+28w\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7\\left(\\dfrac{28+56t+28w}{7}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7\\left(\\dfrac{28}{7}+\\dfrac{56t}{7}+\\dfrac{28w}{7}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=7(4+8t+4w)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $28+56t+28w$ is equivalent to $7(4+8t+4w)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $28+56t+28w$:\n\n- $28(1+2t+w)$\n- $7(4+8t+4w)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $28+56t+28w$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $112+224t+112w$.","content":"$2(56+112t+56w)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $28+56t+28w$.","content":"$28(1+2t+w)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $28+52t+28w$.","content":"$4(7+13t+7w)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $28+56t+28w$.","content":"$7(4+8t+4w)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
